      "type": "function",
      "name": "View \u2192 Settings\u2026",
      "summary": "Opens a dialog with viewer settings (Dark interface, Dark page, Paper size), editor setting (Play the beat after each note edit), and player settings (Start with count-in, Start with metronome). Changes apply immediately and are persisted; Close or Escape dismisses the dialog.",
