      "type": "function",
      "name": "Top Panel \u2014 Player",
      "summary": "Player tab with rewind, play, play selection, pause, stop, count-in, loop, metronome, visual metronome, speed, level, and output selection. Greyed out when nothing can play; a line at the bottom explains why.",
