      "id": "function:docs/manual/src/window.md:left-panel",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "Left Panel \u2014 Palette",
      "summary": "Holds every notation and effect tool of the editor as buttons in groups (voices/modes, bar, note, effects, notation). Supports hover tooltips, key shortcuts, collapsible groups, and a search field (Ctrl+F) for filtering tools by name. Escape returns to the score.",
