      "type": "function",
      "name": "Right Panel \u2014 Inspector",
      "summary": "Four tabs: Song (score information), Track (caret's track, sound, effects), Bar (caret's bar settings), and Note (caret's note and beat). The score sits on a dark background with a zoom slider in the corner.",
