      "type": "function",
      "name": "Panel Behavior",
      "summary": "Each panel has tabs; clicking a tab's name opens it, clicking it again or the chevron folds the panel. Side panels can become thin strips. Drag edges to resize. View \u2192 Panels toggles visibility (F7/F8). Plugins can add tabs to any panel.",
