      "type": "function",
      "name": "Score Zoom",
      "summary": "Enlarges the score only, from 25% to 400%. Accessed by holding Shift and turning the mouse wheel over the score (pointer stays in place) or by dragging the slider in the bottom-right corner. 100% snaps to the middle.",
