      "summary": "Checks that every commit in a range carries a Developer Certificate of Origin sign-off matching the author's email. Skips bot commits (Claude GitHub app, Dependabot) since bots cannot satisfy the DCO. The maintainer's review is the human sign-off for bot commits. Usage: check-dco.sh BASE_SHA HEAD_SHA.",
