    {
      "id": "file:crates/oxiguitar-model/src/drums.rs",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "drums.rs",
      "summary": "The drum kit map: where each General MIDI percussion key sits on a five-line drum staff and on drum tablature, and what it is called.  One map for every drum track (Mateus, 17 Nov 2026; a map the user edits per track may come after v1.0). The engraver draws a drum note where the map puts it, and the editor enters on a line or space what the map puts there, so the two always agree. The layout is the usual drum-kit one: kick in the bottom space, snare in the third space, toms between, cymbals and ",
      "tags": [
        "rust",
        "code",
        "ui",
        "model",
